OL,3,GNEWSA'I watched my gym burn, but the
OL,4,Acommunity rallied'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gym owner from Redditch said he
OL,7,Fthought "it was the end" after a
OL,8,Fdevastating fire destroyed his
OL,9,Fbusiness.
OL,11,FHarry Williams, 31, was woken at 06:45
OL,12,FGMT on 9 November and rushed to the
OL,13,Fscene, only to see firefighters already
OL,14,Ftackling the blaze.
OL,16,F"I was watching everything I'd worked
OL,17,Ffor, for three-and-a-half years, all
OL,18,Fthe blood, sweat and tears I'd put into
OL,19,Fit, all burn in front of me. It was
OL,20,Ftruly heartbreaking."
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
