OL,3,GNEWSA'I watched my gym burn, but the
OL,4,Acommunity rallied'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut almost immediately, Williams' best
OL,7,Ffriend Jay Sprigg started a fundraising
OL,8,Fappeal for The Body Box which brought
OL,9,Fin thousands, including a donation from
OL,10,Finternational fitness brand Gymshark.
